        <h1 id="wcag-main" tabindex="-1" class="mt-8 md:mt-13 title">篩檢項目</h1>

        <ul class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-9 gap-y-12 md:gap-y-15 mx-auto max-w-screen-2xl px-4 mt-8 md:mt-13">
            <li class="">
                <article class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                    <a href="https://health.gov.taipei/News.aspx?n=7AAC649DC5FA7E15"
                       class="relative isolate">
                        <picture>
                            <source type="image/jpeg"
                                    srcset="
                    /images/homepage/img-1.jpg,
                    /images/homepage/img-1@2x.jpg 2x
                  " />
                            <img class="w-full h-[187px] md:h-[375px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md"
                                 src="/images/homepage/img-1.jpg"
                                 alt="醫師幫患者測量血壓" />
                        </picture>
                        <div class="bg-blue text-white flex justify-center items-center size-10 md:size-15.5 rounded-full absolute right-4 bottom-4 md:right-6 md:bottom-6 border border-white">
                            <div class="grid size-4 md:size-6.5" aria-hidden>
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                     aria-hidden="true"
                                     viewBox="0 0 26 26">
                                    <g fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd">
                                        <path d="M0 0h26v26H0z" />
                                        <path fill="currentColor"
                                              fill-rule="nonzero"
                                              d="M20.484 14.233 9.017 25.493c-.69.676-1.81.676-2.5 0a1.715 1.715 0 0 1 0-2.455L16.74 13 6.517 2.962a1.715 1.715 0 0 1 0-2.454 1.79 1.79 0 0 1 2.5 0l11.467 11.26c.346.34.516.784.516 1.232s-.17.892-.516 1.233" />
                                    </g>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="sr-only">前往成人健檢申請頁</span>
                    </a>
                    <h2 class="mx-4 text-2xl md:text-4xl font-semibold md:col-span-2">
                        成人健檢
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mx-4 text-lg md:text-[1.375rem] font-medium leading-9">
                        30-39歲民眾，每5年補助1次成人健檢
                    </p>
                    <p class="mx-4 text-lg md:text-[1.375rem] font-medium leading-9">
                        40-64歲民眾，每3年補助1次成人健檢
                    </p>
                    <p class="mx-4 text-lg md:text-[1.375rem] font-medium leading-9">
                        65歲以上民眾，每年補助1次成人健檢
                    </p>
                </article>
            </li>

            <li class="">
                <article class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                    <a href="https://health.gov.taipei/cp.aspx?n=70B2EC9E4FB30F7E"
                       class="relative isolate">
                        <picture>
                            <source type="image/jpeg"
                                    srcset="
                    /images/homepage/img-2.jpg,
                    /images/homepage/img-2@2x.jpg 2x
                  " />
                            <img class="w-full h-[187px] md:h-[375px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md"
                                 src="/images/homepage/img-2.jpg"
                                 alt="醫師藉由大腸模型向患者說明" />
                        </picture>
                        <div class="bg-blue text-white flex justify-center items-center size-10 md:size-15.5 rounded-full absolute right-4 bottom-4 md:right-6 md:bottom-6 border border-white">
                            <div class="grid size-4 md:size-6.5" aria-hidden>
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                     aria-hidden="true"
                                     viewBox="0 0 26 26">
                                    <g fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd">
                                        <path d="M0 0h26v26H0z" />
                                        <path fill="currentColor"
                                              fill-rule="nonzero"
                                              d="M20.484 14.233 9.017 25.493c-.69.676-1.81.676-2.5 0a1.715 1.715 0 0 1 0-2.455L16.74 13 6.517 2.962a1.715 1.715 0 0 1 0-2.454 1.79 1.79 0 0 1 2.5 0l11.467 11.26c.346.34.516.784.516 1.232s-.17.892-.516 1.233" />
                                    </g>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="sr-only">前往大腸癌篩檢申請頁</span>
                    </a>
                    <h2 class="mx-4 text-2xl md:text-4xl font-semibold md:col-span-2">
                        大腸癌篩檢
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mx-4 text-lg md:text-[1.375rem] font-medium leading-9">
                        45-74歲民眾，每2年補助1次糞便潛血檢查
                    </p>
                    <p class="mx-4 text-lg md:text-[1.375rem] font-medium leading-9">
                        40-44歲且其父母、兄弟姐妹、子女曾患有大腸癌者，每2年補助1次糞便潛血檢查
                    </p>
                </article>
            </li>

